Evaluation Lab results land here as:

  results/{release_id}/{TICKER}.json
  results/{release_id}/_manifest.json
  results/{release_id}/_summary.json

Example:

  results/PR306/HDFCBANK.json
  results/PR306/RELIANCE.json
  results/PR306/TCS.json

Generate with:

  python -m institutional_evaluation_lab.golden_universe --release-id PR306
